+        print('Restart the dashboard (./dashboard.sh or dashboard.bat).')
+        print('Nothing was re-rendered, no voice was re-recorded and no Flow credit was spent. Before spending a '
+              'render on the one-card fix, ask whether this job needs it: python3 cli.py v3 language-outputs <job> '
+              '--card-audit   (read-only, seconds - it names every card that would share the screen and what a '
